Although I have no facts and figures, I suspect that many "green" businesses
are in fact less efficient than others. Since "green" products tend to be
more expensive I would not be surprised to find this indicates the higher      
costs of gathering, seperating and processing recycled materials. This would
include costs in energy, humanpower and equipment that could actually cause
